{
 "description": "Top crypto assets by market rank (GET /v1/top), with change and, by default, the market block (rank, market cap, volume, supply). Size: about 1 KB per asset with market (both copies of the result), smaller without. Default limit is 20 (max 250); pass include_market=false for a compact list. Items that cannot be priced in the requested quote are skipped. Edge cases: read resource ratehub://docs/behavior (behaviour notes).",
